# Live VPS publish

The production site tracks Git branch **`development`** and restarts **`accessibility.service`**.

Whenever the user would need these commands — code merged or pushed to `development`, they ask how to go live, they ask to publish, or a change will not show until the VPS is updated — paste the copy-paste block from **deploy/README.md**. Do not wait for them to ask if the work is meant to be live.

If `package-lock.json` or `web/package-lock.json` changed, also include `npm ci` as `deploy` (root and `web/`).
